        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;UC15&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="-2510" y="-110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. In the Publish step, the Contributor views the checklist of submission conditions. A3." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The Contributor taps &quot;Submit for review&quot; and confirms." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The system (Tour) checks the conditions: complete information, every place has a description, no place is under review or rejected by AI, at most 50 places. E1, E2, E3, E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="345" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system moves the tour to &quot;AI review in progress&quot; and publishes the tour.submitted event (with the tour content) over RabbitMQ. E5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="320" x="-160" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The client polls the status every 5 seconds and shows &quot;AI review in progress&quot;. E8." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="320" x="-160" y="800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. Moderation creates a moderation case and runs the location rules G1–G6." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="990" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. Moderation calls the AI service (/moderate/tour, one LLM call for the whole tour); AI returns findings and their severity. E6, E7." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="320" x="-160" y="1125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="8. Moderation merges the AI result and the location rules (the worst result wins), then publishes tour.ai_passed or tour.ai_rejected. A1, A2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-110" y="1345" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="9. Pass: Tour moves the tour to &quot;Pending review&quot; and into the Admin queue." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="1510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="40" x="-20" y="1675" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E1. Missing required conditions → 422 &quot;The tour does not meet the publishing conditions yet&quot; with the list of failed items and links to where to fix them." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="250" x="355" y="318" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E2. Places still under review / rejected by AI, or more than 50 places → the matching checklist item fails." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="453" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. The tour is in Restricted access mode (UC#14) or hidden by the Admin → 409." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="573" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E4. Not the author → 403; the tour does not exist → 404." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="678" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E5. The event cannot be published (RabbitMQ error) → logged, the tour stays &quot;AI review in progress&quot;; the Contributor can submit again." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="768" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E8. The client status poll fails → &quot;Status could not be updated: …&quot; with a &quot;Retry&quot; button." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="888" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E6. Temporary AI error (timeout, 429, 503) after 3 attempts, or 401 → no result is published; Moderation retries every 60 seconds." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="1105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E7. AI returns 422 (invalid input) → a &quot;needs a human&quot; Warning for the Admin; if G1 already rejected, Reject wins." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="1225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A3. Preview before submitting (UC#13)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-510" y="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1. Warning (0.4 ≤ severity &lt; 0.8, or rules G2–G6): the tour moves to &quot;AI Warning&quot; and to the top of the Admin queue with reasons." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-910" y="1480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="24" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A2. Reject (severity ≥ 0.8, G1 invalid coordinate, or content blocked by the provider): the tour goes back to Draft with reasons; the author receives an in-app and email notification (UC#16), edits and resubmits." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="220" x="-1310" y="1480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="25" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A4. Edit the tour during review: the tour goes back to Draft; the AI result for the old version is ignored (revision check)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-1710" y="1615" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="26" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A5. Each place was already moderated separately on save (UC#10, place.submitted event, checking both text and up to 5 photos); the tour scan does not rescan the places." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-2110" y="1615" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="27" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A6. Moderation turned off (MODERATION_EVENTS_ENABLED=false): the &quot;Publish&quot; button makes the tour public at once, without AI or Admin." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="220" x="-2510" y="1615" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
